 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"b7227362-5b8b-497d-9d53-de53f98c4a1d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The fiber over the first vertex ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " of ",
 StyleBox["loop", "TI"],
 " is indexed in the order of the total vertices over ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", the order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraFiber"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraFiber", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "5a6662d8-e336-493a-b948-a469edc2ab6b"],
 " uses."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"25300e0e-152a-4a6b-9609-7127c566f13c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The call stays unevaluated when the transport around ",
 StyleBox["loop", "TI"],
 " is not a permutation of the fiber: a blocked lift, or a walk that does not \
close."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"3edb1bde-49f7-4900-b124-7b01add73a0a"]
}, Open  ]],

